"## What's Changed\n* feat(desc): add release group tag overrides for description text fields by @wastaken7 in https://github.com/wastaken7/Upload-Assistant/pull/323\n* refactor(desc): add default section values to description generator and clean tracker calls by @wastaken7 in https://github.com/wastaken7/Upload-Assistant/pull/326\n* fix(qbittorrent): improve torrent add resilience and prevent false negative logs by @wastaken7 in https://github.com/wastaken7/Upload-Assistant/pull/327\n* fix(paths): standardize linux data directory casing and update repo references by @wastaken7 in https://github.com/wastaken7/Upload-Assistant/pull/328\n* feat(args): replace tracker-specific id flags with generic --tracker-id and unify client comments by @wastaken7 in https://github.com/wastaken7/Upload-Assistant/pull/329\n* feat: add post-upload custom hooks system by @wastaken7 in https://github.com/wastaken7/Upload-Assistant/pull/331\n* feat(capybarabr): add BiOMA image host support and automatic rehosting by @wastaken7 in https://github.com/wastaken7/Upload-Assistant/pull/332\n* fix: tracker-specific UNIT3D region mappings by @GamerGirlN6467 in https://github.com/wastaken7/Upload-Assistant/pull/333\n* fix(uploadscreens): keep manifest screenshot paths absolute during upload by @wastaken7 in https://github.com/wastaken7/Upload-Assistant/pull/335\n* fix(trackers): fix brasiltracker signature generation and add capybarabr bioma naming tag by @wastaken7 in https://github.com/wastaken7/Upload-Assistant/pull/336\n* feat(trackers): add configurable upload retries and retry logic for anthelion by @wastaken7 in https://github.com/wastaken7/Upload-Assistant/pull/337\n* fix(makingoff): improve audio language resolution and prompt handling by @wastaken7 in https://github.com/wastaken7/Upload-Assistant/pull/338\n* feat(trackers): add featured, doubleup, sticky, and related flags for UNIT3D trackers by @wastaken7 in https://github.com/wastaken7/Upload-Assistant/pull/339\n* fix(makingoff): allow portuguese original language media without subtitles by @wastaken7 in https://github.com/wastaken7/Upload-Assistant/pull/340\n* fix(paths): ensure temp and artwork directories fallback to user state dir by @wastaken7 in https://github.com/wastaken7/Upload-Assistant/pull/341\n* test: add CLI smoke tests for help flags by @wastaken7 in https://github.com/wastaken7/Upload-Assistant/pull/342\n* feat(tags): unify portuguese tracker tags and add audiobook genre mappings by @wastaken7 in https://github.com/wastaken7/Upload-Assistant/pull/343\n* fix(screenshots): preserve tonemapping state from early capture and existing screens by @wastaken7 in https://github.com/wastaken7/Upload-Assistant/pull/345\n* feat(avistaz): support external image hosting for spectrograms and hdr plots in description by @wastaken7 in https://github.com/wastaken7/Upload-Assistant/pull/346\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/wastaken7/Upload-Assistant/compare/v3.6...v3.7"
